<component>
    <CaseDocPage
        title={t("case.table.title")}
        description="Table 是 RML 的 WPF DataGrid 风格表格组件，标签为 PascalCase Table 或小写 table。支持数据绑定式列定义（columns/rows）和声明式 Column 子标签，提供列头模板、列数据模板、合并列等高级功能。"
        code-rml={rml_sample}
        code-rust={rust_sample}>
        <template slot="demo">
            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>1. 数据绑定式（API 文档表格）</h3>
                <Table columns={api_columns} rows={api_rows} bordered="" stripe="" />
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>2. 声明式 Column 定义</h3>
                <Table rows={user_rows} bordered="">
                    <Column key="name" title="姓名" width="120" />
                    <Column key="age" title="年龄" align="center" />
                    <Column key="email" title="邮箱" />
                </Table>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>3. 小写标签形式</h3>
                <table rows={user_rows} bordered="" stripe="">
                    <column key="name" title="姓名" />
                    <column key="age" title="年龄" align="center" />
                    <column key="email" title="邮箱" />
                </table>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>4. 插槽模板（自定义列头和底部）</h3>
                <Table rows={user_rows} bordered="">
                    <Column key="name" title="姓名" />
                    <Column key="age" title="年龄" />
                    <Column key="email" title="邮箱" />
                    <template slot="header">
                        <div display="flex" flex-direction="row" style="color: blue; font-weight: bold; width: 100%;">
                            <span style="flex: 1;">姓名</span>
                            <span style="flex: 1; text-align: center;">年龄</span>
                            <span style="flex: 1;">邮箱</span>
                        </div>
                    </template>
                    <template slot="footer">
                        <span style="color: gray;">表格底部</span>
                    </template>
                </Table>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>5. 单元格模板（Scoped Slot 参数访问）</h3>
                <p>通过 template slot="cell" field="name" 自定义 name 列渲染，模板内可直接引用闭包参数 row_idx。</p>
                <Table rows={user_rows} bordered="">
                    <Column key="name" title="姓名" width="160" />
                    <Column key="age" title="年龄" align="center" />
                    <Column key="email" title="邮箱" />
                    <template slot="cell" field="name">
                        <span style="color: blue; font-weight: bold;">第 {row_idx} 行</span>
                    </template>
                </Table>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>6. 合并列</h3>
                <Table rows={merged_rows} bordered="">
                    <Column key="category" title="分类" width="120" />
                    <Column key="name" title="名称" />
                    <Column key="value" title="值" align="center" />
                </Table>
            </div>
        </template>

        <template slot="api">
            <h3>Table</h3>
            <Table columns={api_columns} rows={api_rows} bordered="" stripe="" />
            <h3>Column（子标签）</h3>
            <Table columns={column_api_columns} rows={column_api_rows} bordered="" stripe="" />
            <h3>Slots（模板插槽）</h3>
            <Table columns={slot_api_columns} rows={slot_api_rows} bordered="" stripe="" />
            <p>另：table 与 Table 标签等价（normalize_component_tag 统一为 Table），column 与 Column 同理。</p>
            <p>另：TableRow::row_span(key, n) 在 Rust 端设置行合并，无需在 RML 声明中配置。</p>
        </template>
    </CaseDocPage>
</component>
